      - 發送招募太快
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_HERO_INFO_ALL_GUILD_SKILL_TO_LEVEL_2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Tăng toàn bộ kĩ năng lên cấp 2
      - Increases all skills to level 2
      - เพิ่มทุกสกิลขึ้นเลเวล 2
      - 將所有技能提升到2級
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_HERO_INFO_LEVEL_UP_TO_100
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
