    - Term: MSG_ARENA_SCENE_DESC_TRIAL_OF_CHAMPION
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Yêu cầu người chơi cấp độ 55 trở lên.
      - Requires level 55 or higher.
      - ผู้เล่นต้องอยู่เลเวล 55 ขึ้นไป.
      - 要求55級以上的玩家
