      - The arena has not yet started
      - สนามแข่งยังไม่ทันเริ่ม
      - 競技場尚未開始
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ARENA_TITLE_REWARD
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Phần thưởng sẽ được trao vào 21:00 (UTC/GMT 0) dựa vào hạng hiện tại trong ngày.
      - Rewards will be awarded at 21:00 (UTC / GMT 0) based on current class for the day.
      - รางวัลจะถูกมอบตอน 21:00 (UTC/GMT 0) ขึ้นอยู่กับอันดับของวันนี้.
      - 獎勵將根據當日排名於21:00（UTC/GMT 0）發放。
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ARENA_TITLE_SEASON_REWARD
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Phần thưởng sẽ được trao dựa trên thứ hạng của bạn khi mùa giải kết thúc.
      - Rewards will be given out based on your ranking at the end of the season.
      - รางวัลจะถูกมอบขึ้นอยู่กับอันดับของคุณ เมื่อเราดูการแข่งขันเสร็จสิ้น.
      - 賽季結束後將根據您的排名進行發獎
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_CALL_ALL_STAR_POINT_PER_HOUR_ADD_SCORE
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - +{0} điểm mỗi 15 phút
      - + {0} points per 15 minutes
      - + {0} คะแนนทุกๆ 15 นาที
      - 每15分鐘增加{0}點
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_CELL_PET_SELECT_BATTLE_NOT_ACTIVED
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Chiến hạm chưa được kích hoạt
      - The warship has not been activated
      - เรือรบยังไม่ได้เปิดใช้งาน.
      - 戰船尚未激活
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_FULL_HERO_FORMATION
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Danh sách tướng ra trận đã đầy
      - You have selected enough heroes
      - รายชื่อฮีโร่ออกรบเต็มแล้ว
      - 出戰英雄已滿
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_LOCK_LINE_UP_1_16
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Không thể xem đội hình người chơi khi chuẩn bị cho vòng 1/16
      - You are not allowed to see other player's formation in this round
      - ไม่สามารถดูทีมของผู้เล่นเมื่อเตรียมตัวสำหรับรอบ1/16
      - 16強賽準備期間不可查看玩家陣容
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_ALL_STAR_BET_DESC
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Trong trận cuối cùng, tổng sát thương của tướng có sát thương cao nhất là chẵn hay lẻ
      - In the last match, total damage of hero with highest damage is odd or even?
      - ในสนามสุดท้าย, ความเสียหายทั้งหมดของฮีโร่มีความเสียหายสูงสุดคู่หรือคี่
      - 在最後一場比賽中，英雄最高傷害的總傷害是奇數還是偶數?
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_ALL_STAR_RESULT_SEMI_FINAL
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - BÁN KẾT
      - SEMI FINAL
      - รอบรองชนะเลิศ
      - 半決賽
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_FORMATION_3_HAS_HERO_ON_ALL_LINE_UP
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Cần xếp thuyền viên vào tất cả các đội hình
      - Crew members need to be placed in all formations
      - ต้องจัดเรียงลูกเรือ ใส่ในทุกรูปแบบการเล่น
      - 需要將船員排到所有陣容
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_SELECT_PET_BATTLE_SHIP_NOT_ALLOW_CHOOSE
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Chiến hạm không được phép chọn
      - This warships is not allowed to choose
      - เรือรบไม่อนุญาตให้เลือก
      - 戰船不可選
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_POPUP_SELECT_PET_CHOOSE_BATTLE_SHIP
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Chọn chiến hạm
      - Choose your warship
      - เลือกเรือรบ
      - 選擇戰船
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
